    "text": "21 hours ago Looking for a loyal companion? The City of Stockton Animal Shelter has several wonderful dogs waiting for their forever homes. From energetic Shepherds to gentle Huskies, there’s a perfect match for every family.\nMORIARTY Breed: German Shepherd Dog\nAge: Adult\nGender: Male\nColor: Tan/Yellow/Fawn\nA classic Shepherd with a noble look and calm presence. Moriarty is ready to be your loyal friend and protector.\nShelter: City of Stockton Animal Shelter\nPhone: (209) 937-7445\n👉 Meet Moriarty and apply to adopt on adoptapet\nFLO Breed: German Shepherd Dog\nAge: Adult\nGender: Female\nColor: Black with brown and chestnut tones\nFlo is a beautiful Shepherd mix with a warm, intelligent gaze. She’s eager to find a loving home.\nShelter: City of Stockton Animal Shelter\nPhone: (209) 937-7445\n👉 Meet Flo and apply to adopt on adoptapet\nSHELDON Breed: Rhodesian Ridgeback\nAge: Adult\nGender: Male\nColor: Red/Golden/Orange/Chestnut\nSheldon is a strong, handsome Ridgeback who would love an active home.\nShelter: City of Stockton Animal Shelter\nPhone: (209) 937-7445\n👉 Meet Sheldon and apply to adopt on adoptapet\nMARLIN Breed: Rhodesian Ridgeback\nAge: Baby\nGender: Male\nColor: Red/Golden/Orange/Chestnut\nThis sweet Ridgeback pup is full of curiosity and ready to grow up with a loving family.\nShelter: City of Stockton Animal Shelter\nPhone: (209) 937-7445\n👉 Meet Marlin and apply to adopt on adoptapet\nOTTO Breed: German Shepherd Dog Mix\nAge: Adult\nGender: Male\nColor: Tan/Yellow/Fawn\nOtto is a loyal Shepherd mix who’s ready to be your best buddy.\nShelter: City of Stockton Animal Shelter\nPhone: (209) 937-7445\n👉 Meet Otto and apply to adopt on adoptapet\nFEZ Breed: German Shepherd Dog Mix\nAge: Baby\nGender: Male\nColor: Black with gray or silver\nFez is a young pup with a shiny coat and bright eyes—ready to learn and love.\nShelter: City of Stockton Animal Shelter\nPhone: (209) 937-7445\n👉 Meet Fez and apply to adopt on adoptapet\nDONNA Breed: German Shepherd Dog Mix\nAge: Baby\nGender: Female\nColor: Black with gray or silver\nDonna is a sweet little Shepherd mix who’s sure to melt your heart.\nShelter: City of Stockton Animal Shelter\nPhone: (209) 937-7445\n👉 Meet Donna and apply to adopt on adoptapet\nKITTY Breed: German Shepherd Dog Mix\nAge: Baby\nGender: Female\nColor: Black with tan or fawn\nKitty is a playful pup who’s ready to bring joy to her new home.\nShelter: City of Stockton Animal Shelter\nPhone: (209) 937-7445\n👉 Meet Kitty and apply to adopt on adoptapet\nLEO Breed: American Staffordshire Terrier / Fox Terrier (Smooth) Mix\nAge: Young\nGender: Female\nColor: Brown/Chocolate\nLeo is a friendly young terrier mix with a big heart and lots of love to give.\nShelter: City of Stockton Animal Shelter\nPhone: (209) 937-7445\n👉 Meet Leo and apply to adopt on adoptapet",
